From 5dbad233f7444af97955a776f3f3ebaf0df464ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <meischris39@hotmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 09:57:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Estuary: Put the game pad icons' buttons the right way round

On a two-button pad the buttons rise to the right. Estuary's pads had
them falling, so the button circle is mirrored.

(cherry picked from commit f739234cd592c6cc7ca898de71b559f6f0908e2e)
